{"seq":1,"slug":"boolean-algebra-and-circuits","title":"布尔代数与开关电路","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/digital-foundations/boolean-algebra-and-circuits","wordCount":1669,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"布尔代数与开关电路\">布尔代数与开关电路</h1><p>香农被记住的多是信息论，但他另有一项贡献，论「催生了今天的世界」未必逊色：在硕士论文里，他证明了乔治·布尔（George Boole）那套十九世纪的逻辑代数，可以用来分析和设计电气开关电路。这篇题为《继电器与开关电路的符号分析》（A Symbolic Analysis of Relay and Switching Circuits）的论文于一九三七年八月十日提交给 MIT，一九三八年发表于美国电气工程师学会（AIEE）会刊第 57 卷，并为他赢得了 1939 年的 Alfred Noble 奖。后人称它为「二十世纪最重要的硕士论文」。</p>\n<p>本篇专讲这项贡献的<strong>技术内核</strong>：逻辑与电路为何能对应、如何用代数取代试错来设计电路。这篇论文作为「人生节点」与「代表作」的叙述，分别见 <a href=\"../../life-and-times/early-life-and-genius/mit-and-the-masters-thesis\">生平·MIT 与硕士论文</a> 与 <a href=\"../../major-works/the-masters-thesis/boolean-algebra-and-switching\">代表作·硕士论文</a>，本篇不重复其传记与版本细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这项贡献的内核是一张严格的对应表：布尔代数的逻辑运算，恰好对应继电器电路的几种基本接法——与（AND）= 串联、或（OR）= 并联、非（NOT）= 常闭触点、真/假 = 通/断。有了这张表，电路与布尔表达式就成了同一件事的两种写法：<strong>验证电路是否导通，等价于验证一个布尔表达式是否为真；化简电路，等价于化简代数式</strong>。于是电路设计从凭经验的试错，变成可计算、可优化的代数运算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缘起-百余个继电器的微分分析机\">缘起：百余个继电器的微分分析机</h2><p>香农的洞见并非凭空而来。他在 MIT 时操作过万尼瓦尔·布什（Vannevar Bush）的微分分析机——一台用上百个继电器控制的庞大模拟计算装置。继电器无非两种状态：通或断。香农早年在密歇根大学修过符号逻辑课，此刻两件事在他脑中接通了：逻辑的「真/假」与开关的「通/断」，是同一回事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心对应-逻辑运算-电路连接\">核心对应：逻辑运算 = 电路连接</h2><p>香农论文的灵魂，是建立了一张严格的对应表。布尔代数的逻辑运算，恰好对应继电器电路的几种基本接法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>布尔逻辑</th>\n<th>记号</th>\n<th>电路实现</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>与 AND</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\cdot B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>两开关<strong>串联</strong></td>\n<td>两个都闭合才导通</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>或 OR</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A + B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>两开关<strong>并联</strong></td>\n<td>任一闭合即导通</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非 NOT</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>常闭触点（反接）</td>\n<td>开关断时电路通</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真 / 假</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通 / 断</td>\n<td>电流有 / 无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;AND = 串联&quot;&#10;        a1[●] --- SA[开关A] --- SB[开关B] --- a2[●]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;OR = 并联&quot;&#10;        b1[●] --- SC[开关A] --- b2[●]&#10;        b1 --- SD[开关B] --- b2&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"AND = 串联\"\n        a1[●] --- SA[开关A] --- SB[开关B] --- a2[●]\n    end\n    subgraph \"OR = 并联\"\n        b1[●] --- SC[开关A] --- b2[●]\n        b1 --- SD[开关B] --- b2\n    end</pre><p>有了这张表，电路与逻辑表达式就成了同一件事的两种写法。一个电路是否导通，等价于一个布尔表达式是否为真——验证一句话：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\cdot B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（串联）要两者皆通才通，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A + B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（并联）只需其一即通，与逻辑「与/或」完全吻合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从试错到计算-代数化简电路\">从试错到计算：代数化简电路</h2><p>这一对应的实用价值是颠覆性的。在香农之前，复杂继电器电路靠工程师凭经验试错搭建；之后，电路设计变成了<strong>代数运算</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>把需求写成布尔表达式（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = A\\cdot B + A\\cdot \\overline{B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；</li>\n<li>用布尔代数定律化简（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = A\\cdot(B+\\overline{B}) = A\\cdot 1 = A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1333em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>）；</li>\n<li>按化简后的最简式搭电路——这里原本要两条支路、三个开关，化简后只需一个开关。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = A\\cdot B + A\\cdot \\overline{B} = A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>化简掉的，是实实在在的继电器、铜线与成本。香农由此把电路设计「从手艺变成了科学」（计算机先驱戈尔斯坦语）——工程师先在纸上把逻辑算到最简，再去焊电路，既省元件又免盲目试错。这种「先抽象、再用代数求最优」的思路，是香农方法的共性，详见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/the-power-of-abstraction/\">思想方法·抽象的力量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何无人先于香农看出\">为何无人先于香农看出</h2><p>布尔代数自 1854 年就在，开关电路也用了几十年，为何八十多年里无人捅破这层窗户纸？因为这需要一个<strong>同时</strong>站在两边的人：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>纯数学家熟悉布尔代数，却不碰继电器；</li>\n<li>电气工程师天天搭电路，却不学符号逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>香农恰好两者兼具——既受过抽象数学训练，又亲手摆弄过那台继电器机器。这正印证了他「思想家 + 修补匠」的双重特质，与他后来独力创立信息论同源（见 <a href=\"../founding-information-theory/the-father-of-information-theory\">信息论之父</a>）。跨越学科藩篱、看出深层同构，是他一生反复施展的同一招。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与边界\">反模式与边界</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>把它误当成「发明了布尔代数」</strong>：布尔代数是布尔 1854 年的成果，香农的贡献是<strong>应用</strong>——把它接到物理电路上，这是「连接两个已有领域」，而非凭空创造。混淆两者会高估也误解他的工作。</li>\n<li><strong>以为它直接造出了计算机</strong>：它奠定的是数字<strong>逻辑电路的设计方法</strong>，是必要的理论地基，但从继电器到晶体管、集成电路、CPU，还需后续大量工程演进。它是地基，不是整栋楼。</li>\n<li><strong>忽略物理约束</strong>：布尔代数是理想模型，真实电路还有时延、竞争冒险、功耗等代数管不到的问题——抽象带来威力，也藏着「把模型当现实」的陷阱。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话定位：香农用布尔代数给开关电路装上了「数学引擎」，让电路设计从试错变为可计算、可优化的代数——这正是数字硬件得以规模化的方法论起点。下一篇把这块「硬件地基」与信息论那块「信息地基」合起来看，理解香农对数字时代的双重奠基。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>延伸</strong>：双重奠基的全景见姊妹篇 <a href=\"foundations-of-digital-age\">数字时代的基础</a>｜传记角度见 <a href=\"../../life-and-times/early-life-and-genius/mit-and-the-masters-thesis\">生平·MIT 与硕士论文</a>｜作为代表作见 <a href=\"../../major-works/the-masters-thesis/boolean-algebra-and-switching\">代表作·硕士论文</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>来源</strong>：Shannon, <em>A Symbolic Analysis of Relay and Switching Circuits</em>, MIT 硕士论文（提交于 1937-08-10），刊于 <em>Transactions of the AIEE</em>, vol. 57 (1938)，获 1939 年 Alfred Noble 奖；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Symbolic_Analysis_of_Relay_and_Switching_Circuits\">A Symbolic Analysis of Relay and Switching Circuits, Wikipedia</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内核是一张对应表：与=串联、或=并联、非=常闭触点、真/假=通/断。</li>\n<li>由此电路设计从试错变成代数运算：写表达式、用布尔定律化简、按最简式搭电路。</li>\n<li>它之所以被看成「划时代」，在于把纯数学变成了整个数字电子学的设计语言。</li>\n<li>反模式：误以为它发明了布尔代数（实为应用），或以为它直接造出了计算机（只是地基）。</li>\n<li>边界：布尔代数是理想模型，时延、竞争冒险、功耗等真实工程问题不在其内。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"布尔代数与开关电路","id":"布尔代数与开关电路"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缘起：百余个继电器的微分分析机","id":"缘起-百余个继电器的微分分析机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心对应：逻辑运算 = 电路连接","id":"核心对应-逻辑运算-电路连接"},{"level":2,"text":"从试错到计算：代数化简电路","id":"从试错到计算-代数化简电路"},{"level":2,"text":"为何无人先于香农看出","id":"为何无人先于香农看出"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与边界","id":"反模式与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信息熵的概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/the-bit-and-entropy/the-concept-of-entropy"},"next":{"title":"数字时代的基础","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/digital-foundations/foundations-of-digital-age"}}